401	    // `eventWrapper`, so the resulting setCurrentIndex call is never flushed before the
402	    // assertion below runs. Routing the same native Event through RTL's generic `fireEvent`
403	    // call form (not one of its `fireEvent.<type>` convenience methods — `scrollend` isn't one
